{
  "title": "Juicy Creamy Turkish Aubergine Dolma",
  "description": "A fresh and creamy Turkish dish featuring aubergine and double-rise-bread, perfect for a cozy meal, and is FODMAP-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Turkish",
